WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.100
Who's involved?

2
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:03.200
Developers maintain the collector.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:07.288
The Microsoft 365 service
owner owns this gate.

4
00:00:07.288 --> 00:00:10.876
The change manager receives the
change and retirement tasks,

5
00:00:10.876 --> 00:00:14.887
and the security officer keeps the
consent record and the run folder.

6
00:00:14.887 --> 00:00:19.162
What the reader may hold is just two read
permissions, and nothing that writes.

7
00:00:19.162 --> 00:00:23.486
Learn says both are granted only by
an administrator, and a delegated

8
00:00:23.486 --> 00:00:28.113
reader also needs an admin role; which
roles Graph accepts isn't specified.

9
00:00:28.113 --> 00:00:32.225
One gap to plan for: data privacy
posts need a Global Administrator

10
00:00:32.225 --> 00:00:36.240
or a Message Center Privacy Reader,
so name one where they matter.
